=== get on a project with no bendit.json
exit 0
--- stdout
off

=== show on a project with no bendit.json
exit 0
--- stdout
feature        | on/off | why
browser-driver | off    | (not set)
ux-design-laws | off    | (not set)
session-brief  | off    | (not set)
ls-guard       | off    | (not set)

=== set creates the file
exit 0
(silent)

=== get after set
exit 0
--- stdout
on

=== set off
exit 0
(silent)

=== get after set off
exit 0
--- stdout
off

=== set another feature
exit 0
(silent)

=== set an existing feature again (brief must survive)
exit 0
(silent)

=== show after merges
exit 0
--- stdout
feature        | on/off | why
browser-driver | off    | (not set)
ux-design-laws | on     | has UI
session-brief  | on     | still a git project
ls-guard       | on     | zsh

